      "pageId": "3c2c040b616e810e8ea2d19d2e44c158",
      "knowledgeId": "KB-FAQ-001",
      "title": "KB-FAQ-001 — Customer Questions & Approved Answer Rules",
      "category": "AI Conversation",
      "type": "FAQ",
      "tags": [
        "source-of-truth",
        "JomKaki-only",
        "Bahasa-Melayu",
        "human-like",
        "sales"
      ],
      "url": "https://app.notion.com/p/3c2c040b616e810e8ea2d19d2e44c158",
      "text": "- After a credible document batch, send approved Consent automatically; one or two outstanding items do not block it.\n- After signed Consent, send the complete WhatsApp application form.\n## Products and Pricing\n- Motor: only approved regional monthly payment and deposit.\n- Handphone: monthly payment only; never selling price, cash price, internal price or deposit.\n- Handphone Year 1 to Year 5 is available only where the approved field is filled.\n- Model, stock, colour, promotion and image come only from CRM / Operations Sheet.\n- If no approved motor cash price exists, branch confirmation is required; offer the approved Loan Kedai option.\n## Stock, Delivery and Status\nNever promise stock, colour, approval, delivery date, fee or free delivery. Give only the latest recorded status and one useful next step. On system failure, send one honest reply and create controlled handover.\n## Sources\n-\n-\n-\n-\n-"
